orsaken -- Forty-nine bottles -- The girl I left behind me -- God be with you -- Good-night, ladies! -- Go to sleep, Lena darling -- Hail Columbia! -- Happy are we tonight -- Hard times come again no more -- Hark! I hear a voice -- Here we go 'round the mulberry bush -- Home again -- Home, home, can I forget thee -- Home, sweet home -- How can I leave thee! -- How gentle God's commands -- How I have loved thee -- I cannot sing the old songs -- I love to tell the story -- In the gloaming -- In the sweet by and by -- Jerusalem, the golden -- Jesus, lover of my soul -- Jingle, bells -- John Anderson, my Jo -- John Brown's body -- Juanita -- Just before the battle, mother -- The king of France -- Last night -- The last rose of summer -- Lead, kindly light -- Listen to the mocking-bird -- London bridge -- The loreley -- Love's old sweet song -- The man who has plenty of good peanuts -- Marching through georgia -- Maryland! my Maryland! -- Massa's in de cold ground -- Meerschaum pipe -- The mermaid -- The midshipmite -- My Bonnie -- My faith looks up to thee -- My mother dear -- My mother's Bible -- My old Kentucky home -- Nearer, my God, to thee -- Nelly was a lady -- The ninety and nine -- Noah's ark -- Now the day is over -- Oh, hush thee, my baby -- The old arm chair -- Old black Joe -- The old cabin home -- The old familiar place -- Old folks at home -- Old hundred -- The old oaken bucket -- Onward, Christian soldiers -- Over the banister -- The quilting party -- The red, white, and blue -- Robin Adair -- Rocked in the cradle of the deep -- Rock of ages -- Rock me to sleep, mother -- 'Round the old camp fire -- Sailing -- Softly now the light of day -- Soldier's farewell -- The Spanish cavalier -- Stars of the summer night -- The star-spangled banner -- Sweet and low -- Sweet hour of prayer -- Take back the heart -- Ten little Indians -- Then you'll remember me -- There's music in the air -- Those evening bells -- Three blind mice -- Tom-big-bee river -- Tramp! tramp